#: main.ts:44 messages.ts:141
msgid "Searching sends the file name keywords and the file hash to the chosen service."
msgstr "搜索会把文件名关键字与文件哈希发送给所选服务。"

#: main.ts:44 messages.ts:141
msgid "First enter an API key for OpenSubtitles under Services (free at opensubtitles.com), or turn on Assrt and enter its token."
msgstr "请先在「服务」中为 OpenSubtitles 填写 API 密钥（在 opensubtitles.com 免费申请），或启用并填写射手网(伪) token。"

